3.8 Climate-Smart Practices
To address climate-related challenges identified during the locality analysis, the project adopted:
•	Rainwater harvesting.
•	Good ventilation.
•	Proper drainage.
•	Deep litter management.
•	Efficient feed utilization.
•	Composting poultry manure.
•	Tree planting around the poultry unit.
•	Proper roof overhang to reduce rain splash.
These practices enhanced environmental conservation and sustainability.
